[00:02.11]Hee-hee 
[00:05.651]Happy happy happy—
[00:08.375]Loading joy… 100% 
[00:17.623]Wake up! Glitter in my eyes,
[00:19.539]Sunshine sticker on my lies.
[00:21.80]Brush my teeth with dopamine,
[00:22.482]Mirror says: “You’re sparkling!”
[00:24.222]Check the box, adjust the grin,
[00:25.811]Tuck the messy feelings in.
[00:27.444]Count to ten and clap on three—
[00:29.38]One, two, three! Look at me! ♡
[00:30.632]Smile wider, hold it steady,
[00:32.182]Don’t you break, be camera ready.
[00:33.908]If you feel it cracking— hush!
[00:35.447]Put some glitter on the blush!
[00:37.85]I’m so happy, can’t you see?!
[00:40.124]Sugar wired electricity!
[00:43.443]Laughing louder, brighter, faster—
[00:46.708]Little walking dopamine disaster!
[00:49.651]Spin me, wind me, pull my string—
[00:51.428]Hear me sing! Hear me sing!
[00:53.111]If I stop the music playing
[00:54.699]You might hear the silence screaming ♡
[00:57.611]But we don’t do that here—
[00:58.967]No no no!
[01:00.705]We don’t do that here.
[01:02.940]♫
[01:09.133]Pink confetti in my veins,
[01:10.673]Candy coating all the stains.
[01:12.213]Every tear’s a glitter drop,
[01:13.802]We don’t let the sparkle stop!
[01:15.436]Post it, pose it, filter bright,
[01:16.933]Glow like artificial light.
[01:18.563]If I’m glowing hard enough
[01:20.149]Maybe I won’t feel the stuff.
[01:21.550]Happiness is mandatory,
[01:23.421]That’s the headline, that’s the story.
[01:25.15]Cry in private, laugh in public—
[01:26.567]Make it cute and make it rhythmic.
[01:28.344]I’m so happy, look at me!
[01:31.207]Perfect little tragedy!
[01:34.484]Bounce and flicker, sweet and vicious—
[01:37.802]Manufactured, bright, delicious!
[01:40.893]Wind me tighter, don’t let go,
[01:42.572]Smile stitched in neon glow.
[01:44.252]If I crack the porcelain—
[01:45.792]Just reboot and try again ♡
[01:48.725]We don’t feel too deep.
[01:50.269]No no no.
[01:52.92]We don’t feel too deep.
[01:54.420]What if I don’t want to sparkle?
[01:57.637]What if quiet isn’t dark?
[02:00.539]What if numb is just a signal
[02:03.989]Not a flaw that needs a mark?
[02:08.370]Error. Error. Error.
[02:09.736]Return to joy protocol.
[02:11.474]♫
[02:17.910]♫
[02:24.270]I’m so happy! Can’t you tell?!
[02:27.396]Tiny painted carousel!
[02:30.480]Round and round the glitter spins—
[02:33.608]Don’t look under where it thins!
[02:36.639]Clap for me! I’ll clap back too!
[02:38.475]See? I’m shining just for you!
[02:40.254]If I laugh a little louder
[02:41.844]Maybe I won’t fall right through ♡
[02:45.00]Happy… happy… happy…
